### Normalized scores (1–100)

**Tool use: 88/100.** Estimated based on pro tier performance and typical agentic capabilities. Caps: strong but not top-tier; comparable to similar-tier pro models.

**Reasoning: 90/100.** Estimated based on rank ~20-30 on AI Intelligence Index for pro tier. Comparison: Gemini 4 Argon (53, rank #8), Claude Opus 5.5 (58, rank #1). Caps: good reasoning but below flagship models.

**Context window: 95/100.** ~1M tokens typical for Pro tier. Caps: good but not the highest; suitable for long documents and RAG.

**Multimodal: 95/100.** Text + image input, text output. 1M context supports documents and images. Caps: standard multimodal for pro models.

**Coding: 85/100.** Estimated based on pro tier coding capabilities. Caps: strong coding but not specialized coding models.

**Cost efficiency: 75/100.** Estimated $2-3/M input, $4-6/M output. 80-90% cache discount. Competitive but not the cheapest. Caps: reasonable value but not exceptional.

**Overall Score: 88/100.** Mean of Tool (88) + Reasoning (90) + Context (95) + Multimodal (95) + Coding (85) = 89.8. Balanced pro model with solid capabilities; good choice for general-purpose work.

